霊烏路空）が巨乳で、私のオリジナルキャラの綾（巨根のフタナリ）にパイズリフェラをしているところを描いていただけませんか？\nできれば、奥羽の顔と胸が精液まみれになる差分画像も欲しい。\n位置や表情はお任せします。\n\n奥羽の参考文献：https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/82123704, https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/112762840\n\n彩の参考文献：https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/19RqL9XgqWCiSTkvnsiADNveWyIsMyntW\n\nありがとう！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/19RqL9XgqWCiSTkvnsiADNveWyIsMyntW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ohiya_apple/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7393a2b5/uploads/origins/ff7e2b60-e098-492c-a886-7ef6ad397919?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=764bfb8a854a3f1f467dcba91f5f738f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7393a2b5/uploads/origins/ff7e2b60-e098-492c-a886-7ef6ad397919?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=764bfb8a854a3f1f467dcba91f5f738f, https://si.imgix.net/7393a2b5/uploads/origins/ff7e2b60-e098-492c-a886-7ef6ad397919?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a6604f870131adcb0d71b3cae0d5bbe2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7393a2b5/uploads/origins/ff7e2b60-e098-492c-a886-7ef6ad397919?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=91c9894c3e1e6fdd41d970d1f7955237 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ohiya_apple/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3869c9bd/uploads/origins/28fade66-e75c-4431-a48a-1b57d6493a2b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5f6774b3b1309f41551351b1870bbef", "thumbnail_srcset": "https